Typography  (https://github.com/LayoutFarm/Typography)
Copyright 2016-present, WinterDev
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
================================================================================

The OpenType parsing and text-layout code under `lib/src/text/` is derived from
Typography, by way of the Dart port in the `dart_graphics` project. Adapted for
dart_ui: glyph outlines are decoded lazily rather than parsing every glyph at
load time, outlines are emitted into dart_ui's own `Path` rather than a separate
glyph point model, and the dependency on `vector_math` was removed.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is included at `test/fonts/Apache-2.0.txt`.

