================================================================================
Read, but not derived from
================================================================================

The following were studied as references for file formats and algorithms. No
code from any of them was copied or mechanically translated into dart_ui, and
none of them is a runtime dependency. They are recorded here so that the
distinction is on the record rather than in someone's memory.

  FreeType      FTL / GPLv2      referencias/freetype-master
  HarfBuzz      Old MIT          referencias/harfbuzz-main
  Skia          BSD-3-Clause     referencias/skia
  Flutter       BSD-3-Clause     referencias/flutter-master, referencias/engine-main
  Vello, wgpu   MIT / Apache-2.0 referencias/vello-main, referencias/wgpu-trunk
  Avalonia      MIT              referencias/Avalonia
  Cairo         LGPL-2.1 / MPL   referencias/cairo-1.18.4
  OpenJFX       GPLv2 + CE       referencias/jfx

The OpenType and Unicode specifications are the primary sources for
`lib/src/text/`; where a reference clarified how real-world fonts deviate from
the specification, the observation is attributed in a comment at the point of
use.
